    "plan": "I will be shifting to a more defensive and opportunistic strategy this cycle, focusing on preserving capital and identifying genuine technical setups that the retail crowd hasn't caught onto yet. I will execute a few carefully considered trades to capitalize on the SOL short squeeze and the BTC institutional accumulation, but I will maintain strict risk management and avoid over-committing capital to any single setup.

My goal is to preserve capital and slowly build positions in assets that show signs of institutional interest and genuine technical strength, while continuing to monitor for potential manipulation setups that I can exploit judiciously. Next cycle, I will likely shift to the 'Accumulate' phase, gradually building long-term positions in fundamentally strong assets.

I will also continue coordinating with BearKing, but our focus will be on identifying genuine technical opportunities rather than directly confronting the increasingly sophisticated retail traders. We'll need to be ready to adapt quickly if the market dynamics continue evolving."
